<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-BLOMQVIST SIGNS FOR AC MILAN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BLOMQVIST SIGNS FOR AC MILAN.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forward Jesper Blomqvist has joined AC Milan from IFK Gothenburg.</p>
<p>No transfer fee was disclosed for the Sweden international who made the announcement on Thursday.</p>
